{"id":98,"name":"Al-Bayyinah","nameAr":"البينة","nameFr":"La preuve","place":"madinah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"98:1","fr":"Les infidèles parmi les gens du Livre, ainsi que les Associateurs, ne cesseront pas de mécroire jusqu’à ce que leur vienne la Preuve évidente :","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/098001.mp3","w":[{"t":"لَمْ","en":"Not","tr":"lam","l":"لَم","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/098_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَكُنِ","en":"were","tr":"yakuni","l":"كانَ","r":"كون","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/098_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"كَفَرُوا۟","en":"disbelieved","tr":"kafarū","l":"كَفَرَ","r":"كفر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"مِنْ","en":"from","tr":"min","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"أَهْلِ","en":"(the) People","tr":"ahli","l":"أَهْل","r":"أهل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en":"of the Book","tr":"l-kitābi","l":"كِتاب","r":"كتب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en":"and the polytheists","tr":"wal-mush'rikīna","l":"مُشْرِك","r":"شرك","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"مُنفَكِّينَ","en":"to be abandoned","tr":"munfakkīna","l":"مُنفَكّ","r":"فكك","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_001_009.mp3"},{"t":"حَتَّىٰ","en":"until","tr":"ḥattā","l":"حَتَّى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_001_010.mp3"},{"t":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","en":"(there) comes to them","tr":"tatiyahumu","l":"أَتَى","r":"أتي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","en":"the clear evidence","tr":"l-bayinatu","l":"بَيِّنَة","r":"بين","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_001_012.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"98:2","fr":"un Messager, de la part d’Allah, qui leur récite des feuilles purifiées,","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/098002.mp3","w":[{"t":"رَسُولٌۭ","en":"A Messenger","tr":"rasūlun","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"مِّنَ","en":"from","tr":"mina","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/09