,"r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/098_004_009.mp3"},{"t":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","en":"came (to) them","tr":"jāathumu","l":"جاءَ","r":"جيأ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_004_010.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","en":"(of) the clear evidence","tr":"l-bayinatu","l":"بَيِّنَة","r":"بين","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_004_011.mp3"}]},{"n":5,"k":"98:5","fr":"Il ne leur a été commandé, cependant, que d’adorer Allah, Lui vouant un culte exclusif, d’accomplir la prière (As-Salât) et d’acquitter l'aumône (Az-Zakât). Et voilà la religion de droiture.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/098005.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَمَآ","en":"And not","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/098_005_001.mp3"},{"t":"أُمِرُوٓا۟","en":"they were commanded","tr":"umirū","l":"أَمَرَ","r":"أمر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_005_002.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَّا","en":"except","tr":"illā","l":"إِلّا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_005_003.mp3"},{"t":"لِيَعْبُدُوا۟","en":"to worship","tr":"liyaʿbudū","l":"عَبَدَ","r":"عبد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_005_004.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهَ","en":"Allah","tr":"l-laha","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/098_005_005.mp3"},{"t":"مُخْلِصِينَ","en":"(being) sincere","tr":"mukh'liṣīna","l":"مُخْلِص","r":"خلص","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_005_006.mp3"},{"t":"لَهُ","en":"to Him","tr":"lahu","l":"لَهُ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/098_005_007.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلدِّينَ","en":"(in) the religion","tr":"l-dīna","l":"دِين","r":"دين","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_005_008.mp3"},{"t":"حُنَفَآءَ","en":"upright","tr":"ḥunafāa","l":"حَنِيف","r":"حنف","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_005_009.mp3"},{"t":"وَيُقِيمُوا۟","en":"and to establish","tr":"wayuqīmū","l":"أَقامَ","r":"قوم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_005_010.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en":"the prayer","tr":"l-ṣalata","l":"صَلاة","r":"صلو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_005_011.mp3"},{"t":"وَيُؤْتُوا۟","en":"and to give","tr":"wayu'tū","l":"آتَى","r":"أتي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_005_012.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ ۚ","en":"the zakah","tr":"l-zakata","l":"زَكاة","r":"زكو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_005_013.mp3"},{"t":"وَذَٰلِكَ","en":"And that","tr":"wadhālika","l":"ذا","r":null,"p":"démonstratif","a":"wbw/098_005_015.mp3"},{"t":"دِينُ","en":"(is the) religion","tr":"dīnu","l":"دِين","r":"دين","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_005_016.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْقَيِّمَةِ","en":"the correct","tr":"l-qayimati","l":"قَيِّمَة","r":"قوم","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_005_017.mp3"}]},{"n":6,"k":"98:6","fr":"Les infidèles parmi les gens du Livre, ainsi que les Associateurs iront au feu de l’Enfer, pour y demeurer éternellement. De toute la création, ce sont eux les pires.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/098006.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","tr":"inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"those who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/098_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"كَفَرُوا۟","en":"disbelieve","tr":"kafarū","l":"كَفَرَ","r":"كفر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/098_006_003.mp3"},{"t":"مِنْ","en":"from","tr":"min","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_006_004.mp3"},{"t":"أَهْلِ","en":"(the) People","tr":"ahli","l":"أَهْل","r":"أهل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_006_005.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en":"(of) the Book","tr":"l-kitābi","l":"كِتاب","r":"كتب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_006_006.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en":"and the polytheists","tr":"wal-mush'rikīna","l":"مُشْرِك","r":"شرك","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_006_007.mp3"},{"t":"فِى","en":"(will be) in","tr":"fī","l":"فِي","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_006_008.mp3"},{"t":"نَارِ","en":"(the) Fire","tr":"nāri","l":"نار","r":"نور","p":"nom","a":"wbw/098_006_009.mp3"},{"t":"جَهَنَّمَ","en":"(of) Hell","tr":"jahannama","l":"جَهَنَّم","r":null,"p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/098_006_010.mp3"},{"t":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en":"abiding eternally","tr":"khālidīna","l":"خالِد","r":"خلد","p":"particule","a":"wbw/098_006_011.mp3"},{"t":"فِيهَآ ۚ","en":"therein","tr":"fīhā","l":"فِي","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/098_006_012.mp3"},{"t":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en":"Those ","tr":"ulāik